# Build context of the images built from the monorepo root (apps/*/Dockerfile).
# Only sources and lockfiles go to Docker: dependencies and build outputs are
# recreated inside the image, and no .env (with real secrets) ever leaves the machine.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/cdk.out
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
**/.git
.claude
.agents
openspec
apps/cli
apps/frontend
apps/infra
